# skill-switch
===
 SkillSwitch is a cross-platform desktop application built specifically for users of AI programming assistants. It allows you to manage skill files for multiple AI tools (Claude Code, Codex CLI, Gemini CLI, Cursor, Windsurf) in a unified interface - including installed management, discovering new skills, creating custom skills, and backup and recovery. ..
